WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.210
Damballa is an ancient Haitian deity.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:06.530
He is one of the Lwa, the spirits observed
in the African religion known as Haitian Vodou.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:10.400
In Vodou, Damballa is a great white serpent
deity associated with water.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.429
Some versions of the religion believe Damballa
was the primordial creator of life, while

00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:18.300
others believe he was the first creation of
God; that Damballa shed his skin to create

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.769
water and thus generate life throughout the
Earth.

00:00:20.769 --> 00:00:24.599
In the Chucky franchise, Damballa is tied
to water in a slightly different way.

00:00:24.599 --> 00:00:28.199
Whenever the deity is called upon, he manifests
himself in the form of storm clouds, and usually

00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:30.710
takes action as a great strike of lighting.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.830
Both the Haitian Vodou and Child’s Play versions
seem to have a say in all things concerning

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.611
life, death and overall: a whole lot of power.

00:00:37.773 --> 00:00:41.128
- [Chucky] Give me the power I beg of you!!!

00:00:41.191 --> 00:00:43.050
(thunder)

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.969
- To learn how the infamous American criminal
Charles Lee Ray got mixed up with this eternal

00:00:46.969 --> 00:00:49.843
Haitian deity, stick around to the end of this
video.

00:00:49.843 --> 00:00:51.733
(metal music)

00:00:55.269 --> 00:00:58.670
Ade due Susanballa.

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:01.100
Give me the views I beg of you!!!

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.449
Welcome to Horror History.

00:01:02.449 --> 00:01:06.130
In today’s lesson we’re looking beyond
the evil of a man driven to beat death to

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:09.820
continue his crime career, to the ancient
misused power that enabled him.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:13.610
The voodoo lore aspect of the Child’s Play
franchise is mostly not expanded upon in the

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:17.390
movies, in fact, series creator Don Mancini
acknowledges that he never even planned to

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:20.490
include it; it was actually added by the director
and other screenwriters.

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:24.670
In his 2017 interview with Slashfilm, he admits
that he didn’t create the voodoo stuff,

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:28.310
he didn’t really like it, but he acknowledges
that it’s a useful plot device that resonated

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:29.420
with audiences.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:33.270
It seems that’s why he uses it in a comedic
fashion later on in the franchise, and probably

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:36.659
the answer for why “The Heart of Damballa”
is such a poorly implemented retcon.

00:01:36.659 --> 00:01:40.990
We’ll get to that, but first, to get to
the origins of Damballa, from my observations

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:45.444
for your education -- I’ve gotta take it
back to the creation of the Haitian nation.

00:01:45.444 --> 00:01:49.303
(mysterious music)

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:54.060
According to Sacred Arts of Haitian Vodou,
the religion is a blend of even more ancient

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:57.590
religions brought to the island nation of
Haiti in the slave trade that occured starting

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:58.930
in 1500s.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:02.549
This caused those religions to blend with
European religions practiced by slave merchants,

00:02:02.549 --> 00:02:06.009
and the culture started to spread out from
the western half of this Caribbean island.

00:02:06.009 --> 00:02:10.090
The word ‘Vodou’ means spirit in Fang
(fong), a language used in Western Africa.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:13.770
Historians have theorized that the religion
resonated with slaves because they felt powerless

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:17.270
in their situation and these spirits seemed
to offer them an ancient power.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.730
We see a similar scenario play out in Child’s
Play, where Charles Lee Ray is dying and he

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:23.110
seeks out Damballa’s power in a moment of
desperation.

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:24.740
But, we’ll get to that.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.890
If you’re like me, when you think of Voodoo
there are a few things that come to mind.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:32.880
The Diablo Swing Orchestra song, the third
level in Sly Cooper, Voodoo Donuts, Voodoo dolls and some

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.530
of the earliest zombie movies.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:38.370
It’s not difficult to see that pop culture
is partially responsible for the western idea

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:41.860
that Vodou is rooted in evil, when that's
not necessarily the case.

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:43.420
For example, take Voodoo dolls.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.950
Believers could attempt to use them for medicinal
purposes to drive energy to one part of the

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:50.240
body for healing, or as a token to help communicate
with passed family members.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.480
But we all know the other side of Voodoo dolls,
they are believed to act as an effigy, or

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:57.840
sculptural representation of a real person,
and are often seen being pricked or stabbed

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.529
with needles in order to bring pain to that
person, or worse.

00:03:03.026 --> 00:03:04.469
- AUUGHHHH!!!!

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.200
- So long, John.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.510
- Items like Voodoo dolls are called pwen; they
are essentially items crafted with components

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:13.620
that appeal to the lwa, the Voodoo spirits that 
I mentioned earlier, and Damballa is one of,

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.550
if not the most prominent of these spirits.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:19.450
It stands to reason that Damballa operates
under the same neutrality that a Voodoo doll

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:20.450
does.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.351
When put into the hands of someone good, they
will attempt to use it for communication and healing.

00:03:23.351 --> 00:03:27.470
But put the power into the hands of an evil
doer, and that person may use it for revenge,

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:30.920
destruction, or completely destroying the
reputation of a toy company, desecrating a

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:34.560
military academy and driving an entire middle
school to near insanity.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.540
Vodou worshippers pay their respects to Damballa
in a serpent temple in Benin, West

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:41.700
Africa, one of the countries that Haitian
Vodou is said to have derived from.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:46.130
Unlike depictions of serpents in major western
religions, Damballa is often depicted standing

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:50.840
upright, separating it from the negative snakey
depictions in Judaism, Christianity and Harry

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:51.840
Potter.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.790
During slavery, the Haitians were not allowed
to practice their religion due to growing

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.860
fears of their power from slave owners.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:01.110
According to a voodoo exploration on Ancient
Mysteries, they instead honored the image

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:05.020
of St. Patrick of Ireland, like the guy who
has his own day named after him, because he

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:07.940
supposedly was responsible for helping banish
snakes from Ireland.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:11.630
Not sure what the story is there, but it sounds
like the slaves had the same strategy as Lexi

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.650
in the Chucky series.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:15.720
If they got caught, they could just say they
were trying to do the right thing.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.540
- [Mrs. Fairchild] I want you to take the
page down.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:18.540
Right now.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.140
- [Lexi] But Mrs. Fairchild, I’ve already
raised $75.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:25.000
In real life, Damballa is viewed as a bestower
of health, prosperity, and fertility and in

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:28.700
a small way, the Chucky version of Damballa
holds true to that, giving several characters

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:32.470
a second chance at life by granting their
wish to inhabit a new body, and even at one

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.310
point helping initiate a Voodoo pregnancy.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:38.764
- [Chucky] I don't think I can take nine months
of this sh*t.

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:40.308
- [Tiffany] Silly Chucky.

00:04:40.308 --> 00:04:42.393
It's a voodoo pregnancy.

00:04:42.393 --> 00:04:44.156
It's accelerated.

00:04:44.244 --> 00:04:45.917
- How accelerated?

00:04:45.917 --> 00:04:49.430
- In a sense, Damballa touches on another common
Voodoo trope: zombies.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:53.120
It’s weird to think of Chucky as a zombie,
because most modern zombies are tied to some

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:56.520
kind of disease, radiation, experiment or
Cranberries song.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.780
But the word ‘Zombie’ actually derives
from the Haitian French word ‘Zombi’,

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:02.380
meaning dead person reanimated through voodoo.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:06.150
What happens with Chucky is very similar,
only instead of a body coming back to life

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:09.720
at the command of a Voodoo spell, it’s a
toy coming to life for the first time.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:13.444
And then that toy is brought back again, and
again, and again, and again, and again, and

00:05:13.444 --> 00:05:14.444
so on.

00:05:14.444 --> 00:05:18.030
In the early days of the United States, Damballa
and the Vodou religion did make it over to

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:22.380
America, once again, unfortunately traveling
overseas by way of the transport of enslaved

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.380
Africans.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.600
Louisiana would become the centerplace for
Voodoo in the US, and Damballa was mostly

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:31.010
worshipped by those of African descent, who
over time spread out to other areas of the country.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:35.340
Things would change in the 1980s, when one
Voodoo devotee spread word of Damballa’s

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:36.983
power to an outsider.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.490
One of the voodoo families was the Bishop
family.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.990
I’m assuming they were one of the most proficient
in the use of Voodoo magic and contacting

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:52.990
the Lwa.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.080
They distanced themselves from New Orleans
and ended up in Chicago, Illinois.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.930
One day, John Aelsop Bishop was approached
by a man named Charles Lee Ray, who was interested

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:03.650
in learning about the power to beat death,
and John taught him the ways of Damballa,

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.380
not knowing that Charles would be using his
teachings for evil.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.560
Chucky completely devotes himself to Damballa,
repainting his apartment to murals worshipping

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:14.990
the great serpent deity, with text that reads:
“Oh thank you Mighty Damballa for life after

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:15.990
death.”

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.670
He also collects a variety of Voodoo artifacts.

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:21.660
It’s likely that John also taught Charles
about a magical amulet called The Heart of

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:22.660
Damballa.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:25.870
It seems the heart gives it’s wearer enhanced
capabilities, and it is likely that Chucky

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:29.110
stole it from John and started wearing it
whenever he went on a dangerous crime spree

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.110
in case he sustained a life threatening injury.

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:35.930
We’re first introduced to Damballa early
in the morning on November 9th, 1988, the

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.900
same day as Charles Lee Ray’s death.

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:39.389
At least in his original body.

00:06:39.389 --> 00:06:43.080
Charles is badly injured in a gunfight with
police and wanders into a toy store to find

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.317
a subject for his ritual.

00:06:44.317 --> 00:06:47.120
Unable to, he decides to try using it on a
Good Guy doll.

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:50.868
- [Charles] Ade due Damballa.

00:06:50.868 --> 00:06:54.433
Give me the power I beg of you!

00:06:54.508 --> 00:06:56.414
(thunder)

00:06:56.414 --> 00:07:01.046
- [Zac] Dark storm clouds roll into the neighborhood
at an alarming rate and a thunderstorm suddenly begins.

00:07:01.046 --> 00:07:05.000
As Charles finishes the chant, lighting strikes
the top of the building, shattering the glass

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.900
and creating an explosive amount of energy
sending a police officer and many toys flying

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.174
through the front windows.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.935
(explosion)

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:20.190
The power of Damballa has allowed Charles
to transfer his soul into the doll, but there

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:21.490
is a caveat.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:25.120
Chucky will slowly turn human over the next
48 hours, and if time expires, he will be

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:28.280
unable to transfer back into a human body
during this incarnation.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:33.580
- The more time you spend in that body, the
more human you become.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.800
- The next day, Chucky demands that John help
him get out of the doll’s body, and abuses

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:40.480
John’s own personal voodoo doll to try to
coerce him, eventually learning he must perform

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.970
the Damballa chant again to transfer his soul
into the first human being he revealed his

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.050
true self to.

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:47.700
Not staying true to his word, he finishes
John off using the doll anyway.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:52.060
He calls on Damballa again on November 11th
to try to transfer his soul into the body

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.550
of 6-year-old Andy Barclay.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:57.460
The storm clouds appear as they had before,
and bolts of lightning come down to signify Damballa

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:01.000
offering his power, but Andy’s mom interrupts
the ritual before it is completed, so the

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.010
soul transfer never takes place.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:05.550
Chucky is reconstructed in October of 1990.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:09.300
Once he is fully reassembled, we see Damballa’s
power activate once again in the powerful

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.760
lightning bolts that seem to come out from
within Chucky.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:15.260
It seems that by transferring his soul into
the doll, Damballa would allow him to possess

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.190
that doll and have life again whenever the
doll is reformed.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.920
Chucky catches up with Andy and tries to perform
the soul-transfer ritual again, but this time

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.211
is interrupted even earlier in the process.

00:08:24.211 --> 00:08:27.330
He tries again two days later, and this time
he’s able to complete the chant on Andy

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:30.690
for the first time, but the soul transfer
still does not occur, and Damballa’s storm

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.820
clouds roll back after the failed attempt.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:35.580
Chucky’s first inclination is that he was
too late.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:39.440
Since his heart had turned human before completing
the ritual, he was no longer able to do it.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:43.080
However, it’s unclear at this stage if that
was the reason, or if it was because he no

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.050
longer had the Heart of Damballa with him.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.750
I’ll answer that a little bit later.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.960
His next attempt is in Spring of 1999 when he’s
reincarnated again and tries to transfer his

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:54.960
soul into a new target, this time a military
school student named Ronald Tyler.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:58.830
This time he succeeds in summoning the storm
clouds, but again, cannot complete the chant

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:02.200
due to an interruption by two superior officers,
who confiscate the doll.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:06.067
He eventually does catch up with Tyler inside
of the coolest carnival dark-ride ever.

00:09:06.067 --> 00:09:09.845
- [Chucky] Give me the power I beg of you!!!

00:09:10.762 --> 00:09:12.028
- You must DIE!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:13.486
(thunder)

00:09:13.601 --> 00:09:20.516
- Morteisme lieu de vocuier de mieu vochette. Endelieu pour de boisette Damballa!!! 

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:23.700
- [Zac] This time, he’s unable to complete the chant
because Andy shoots him, though he does get

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.700
really close.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:28.120
I’m guessing that Damballa was itching for
action at this point, and was probably disappointed

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.380
he didn’t get to do his thing.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.890
However he would get back into the swing of
things not long after that, when Chucky’s

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.931
ex-girlfriend, Tiffany Valentine, reassembled
the doll and placed it on a pentagram in her

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.540
trailer, apparently trying to mix Haitian
Vodou with Satanism.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:43.440
I guess merely reassembling the doll again
no longer worked, possibly because it wasn’t

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:47.140
a perfect recreation, so she calls upon Damballa’s
power to help her out.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:50.630
Using a book called Voodoo For Dummies, she
finds a new spell capable of bringing Chucky

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:51.630
back to life.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:53.740
It doesn’t appear to be effective at first…

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:54.740
- Awake!!

00:09:55.709 --> 00:09:56.709
Awake!

00:09:57.283 --> 00:09:59.056
Awake, awake, awake!

00:09:59.056 --> 00:10:01.680
...but Chucky does regain consciousness that
evening.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:05.110
The next day he electrocutes Tiffany, but
in an attempt to salvage her, calls on Damballa

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:09.010
again to transfer her soul from her human
body into the body of this doll.

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:12.370
She desperately searches for another spell
to revert her back to a human body, and Chucky

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:16.360
informs her that the only way to do it is
with the amulet known as The Heart of Damballa.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:19.810
This brings up the question: why did Chucky
ever attempt to transfer into a human body

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.120
before, without first retrieving the amulet?

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.960
Is this what prevented him from being successful
with Andy, or was it actually because he was

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.060
too late and had already turned part-human?

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:32.250
The closest I can get to answering that question
is the Slashfilm article I referenced earlier.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:36.460
Don Mancini addresses the issue when the interviewer
asks why Chucky suddenly needs the amulet

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.020
four movies into the franchise.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:41.611
"Hey, that contradicts what Chucky's been
trying to do in the first three movies," but

00:10:41.611 --> 00:10:45.630
my feeling was no, maybe that's why he was
unsuccessful in the first three movies.

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.420
He wasn't using the Heart of Damballa.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.620
He was a student of voodoo so I went with
the logic that he was constantly learning

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.930
about this very complicated mythology.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:57.210
Obviously this is just a quote in an interview,
not necessarily canon, but it’s the closest

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.790
we’re ever going to get to an answer, so
I’ll roll with that.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:03.710
To this point, Damballa’s power is mostly
used unsuccessfully for soul transfer rituals

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:08.150
with the occasional awakening ritual thrown
in, but things were about to get more complicated,

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:12.078
and we would see the true scope of Damballa’s
power for the first time.

00:11:21.117 --> 00:11:24.980
After retrieving the amulet, Chucky makes
yet another attempt to perform Damballa’s

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.330
soul transfer ritual.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.570
This time, his wife Tiffany is the one to
foil him by stabbing him in the back.

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.910
Kind of a tease from Damballa’s point of
view.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:35.560
Chucky and Tiffany are both dead in a matter
of minutes, but with her last ounce of life,

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.750
Tiffany gives birth to their child, Glen.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:41.500
Glen is found in the cemetery with the Heart
of Damballa and holds onto it, not knowing

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:45.890
the truth behind its power until 5 years later
in March of 2004, when he finds his parents,

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.660
who have now been relegated to inanimate movie
props.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.020
He reads the inscription on the back of it,
which happens to be the same awaken spell

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.666
that Tiffany used to bring back Chucky in
‘99.

00:11:54.666 --> 00:11:57.726
- [Glen] Ade due Damballa.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:59.450
Awake.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:03.790
- As usual, the result is an overload of electricity,
but the spell is successful in bringing both

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:07.200
dolls back to life, which later results in
Chucky trying to transfer all three of their

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.839
souls into human bodies, this time with the
Heart of Damballa in hand to aid him.

00:12:10.839 --> 00:12:15.430
This 8th attempt is, of course, unsuccessful,
but this time Chucky himself is the one to

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.303
stop it.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:23.660
- This is nuts, and I have a very high tolerance
for nuts.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:28.920
If this is what it takes to be human, then
I would rather take my chances as a supernaturally

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.540
possessed doll, it’s less complicated.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.930
- Chucky decides he’d rather remain in doll
form because he feels that version of him

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:38.050
is a more infamous killer than his human form,
Charles Lee Ray.

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:42.279
As I discussed earlier, Damballa has, and
will always be impartial to good vs. evil,

00:12:42.279 --> 00:12:45.140
and allows Chucky to go on living as a doll
most likely forever.

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:48.990
However, that does not spell the end of Damballa’s
involvement, because Tiffany still wants a

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.800
human body for her and her child.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:54.100
She knocks out Hollywood actress Jennifer
Tilly and performs the chant on her.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:57.470
It takes a few moments after completing the
ritual, but she is successfully switched into

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:58.580
the human body.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:12:59.517
Just in time too.

00:13:00.602 --> 00:13:01.190
- AHH!

00:13:01.293 --> 00:13:02.207
- Noooo!!!

00:13:03.882 --> 00:13:05.882
- Nobody leaves me...

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:10.410
Tiffany takes the amulet, and uses it to transfer
Glen’s soul into one of a pair of human

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.010
twins, or possibly both twins.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:14.730
It’s never explicitly explained how that
all went down.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:18.440
Either Glen is able to possess both human
bodies at once, or he or she is switching

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.080
back and forth between the two whenever he
or she pleases.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:24.330
Many years go by before Chucky attempts to
contact Damballa again.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:28.810
He does so on April 8th, 2013 with Alice Pierce,
the granddaughter of one of his love interests

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:30.290
from 25 years ago.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.933
- [Chucky] Ade due Damballa.

00:13:33.933 --> 00:13:38.339
Give me the power I beg of you.

00:13:38.339 --> 00:13:41.740
We don’t actually know if he was successful
with this though, but according to Chucky

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:45.580
himself, he is able to transfer his own soul
back into a human body with the help of a

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.000
brand new voodoo spell that he discovered
on the internet…

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.117
- ****ing internet.

00:13:49.117 --> 00:13:52.942
- [Zac] ...that allows him to transfer his soul into
more than one body at a time.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:14:00.560
-  [Chucky] A few years ago I came across this groovy new spell
on voodoofordummies.com that changed everything.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.551
Now, I can be me.

00:14:02.551 --> 00:14:03.390
- And me.

00:14:03.551 --> 00:14:04.551
- And me.

00:14:04.695 --> 00:14:10.450
- And theoretically anyone or anything with
two legs and a hand for stabbing.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:11.730
Like Alice.

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:15.620
He takes advantage of this by transferring
himself into two duplicate Good Guy dolls,

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:18.230
so he’s now inhabiting three bodies thanks
to Damballa.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:20.690
- [Zac] One of them is most likely killed, and the
other is captured.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:23.579
If you want to know more about that, you gotta
watch my Andy Barclay Horror History.

00:14:23.579 --> 00:14:26.507
- Actually there’s three of us at the moment.

00:14:26.507 --> 00:14:28.450
And the Cult is growing.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:29.890
All the time.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:34.570
- [Zac] In January 2017, the remaining one free Chucky
doll goes to Harrogate Psychiatric Hospital,

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:38.029
where he encounters two more Good Guy dolls,
and expands his cult out into them.

00:14:38.029 --> 00:14:41.600
One interesting note about this new Damballa
spell is that after the transfer, the Chuckys

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.529
appear to operate independently.

00:14:43.529 --> 00:14:45.160
That is, they aren’t a hive mind.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:48.680
If you share information with just one of
them, the others aren’t necessarily going

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.110
to know that information.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:54.309
One of the three Chuckys at the asylum has
one more task for his Voodoo overlord though.

00:14:54.309 --> 00:14:55.668
Roll it.

00:14:56.974 --> 00:15:06.300
- Ade boku Damballa, give me all the power
I beg of you!!!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:11.339
He uses the spell on the 29 year old parapeligec
woman Nica Pierce, and it’s here we see

00:15:11.339 --> 00:15:14.160
one more interesting side effect of the power
of Voodoo.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:17.279
For the first time since she was born, Nica
is able to walk.

00:15:17.279 --> 00:15:20.830
Her legs are functional with Charles Lee Ray’s
soul taking over her body.

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:22.950
When you think about it, this makes a lot
of sense.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:27.228
Non-disabled people are able to stand up and
walk because of the muscles in our legs exerting force.

00:15:27.228 --> 00:15:31.517
A good guy doll has no muscles, but Chucky
has always been able to walk while inhabiting them.

00:15:31.517 --> 00:15:34.320
That means it’s Damballa’s magic that's moving them.

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:37.550
Nica’s legs don’t work, but it’s OK,
because they are also moved thanks to the

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:38.550
might of Damballa.

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:42.920
There is one more Damballa intervention that
we know of, which is Tiffany using the voodoofordummies.com

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.300
curse to split her soul back into the female
doll -- we don’t know exactly when this

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.120
happens, but it’s most likely the last one
chronologically.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:53.431
With Chucky back again in the 20s, it is likely
that Damballa will strike again in the near future.

00:15:53.431 --> 00:15:56.713
I think this is the perfect
place to end this lesson on Damballa.

00:15:56.713 --> 00:16:00.120
If you like what you saw, check that playlist
on the left where I analyze the histories

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.970
of other Chucky franchise characters.

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:06.160
I’ve also covered deities and spirits from
other franchises, such as The Conjuring franchise,

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:09.810
the world of Stephen King and others, so if
that interests you, make sure you subscribe

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:15.200
to CZsWorld for new horrors every week, ring
the deathbell for all notifications and I’ll

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:19.219
see you in the next one, assuming we both
survive.

